  "translation": "Pekah (Pekaya), Remaliah (Remaliya) denkɛ, a shalisho (sababatigi-saba), ye a laɲini k'a bɔ a fɛ; a ye a Shomron (Samari) mara, masakɛ so ka jɔsirili-kɔnɔ, ⟨את⟩ Argob ni ⟨את⟩ Aryeh fɛ, ni mɔgɔ de-bi-tan Giladi (Giliya) denw la; o ye a saya-ɲɛfɔ kɛ, a yɛrɛ tun to a nɔ na.",
